{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13217500","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13217500","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1321750001:0":{"text":"这……这几只水豚……","source_cn":"这……这几只水豚……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AA9DEDF30E5D8A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321750002:0":{"text":"怎么了？这些水豚有问题吗？","source_cn":"怎么了？这些水豚有问题吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54B7BA987E8080E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321750003:0":{"text":"这几只水豚，是大公阁下在公主殿下生病后，特意送来陪伴殿下的宠物……","source_cn":"这几只水豚，是大公阁下在公主殿下生病后，特意送来陪伴殿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68A5F0C99D8F0DF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321750004:0":{"text":"公主殿下临终时，担心这些水豚会让大公阁下触景生情，所以特意嘱咐我，将它们送给可靠的牧民照顾。","source_cn":"公主殿下临终时，担心这些水豚会让大公阁下触景生情，所以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E51D6A54198398B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321750005:0":{"text":"我早就已经将它们送走了……可现在它们就在这里，而且看起来和城堡里的人很亲近。","source_cn":"我早就已经将它们送走了……可现在它们就在这里，而且看起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00F391776C030576","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_